# ::tok The Hong Kong Tourism Board organized a delegation of more than 100 people comprising representatives from the Hong Kong government's tourism sector, the tourism industry and the media to Macau. In addition to working meetings and industry briefings, the Hong Kong travel industry and media representatives went on to visit several tourist attractions, hotels and tourism related facilities in Macau, to introduce the newest Macau tourism products to the Hong Kong market, and to promote geographical tourism between the two countries.
