# ::tok With the rapid popularization of the application of lithium batteries, the lithium battery business of Sugihiro began to develop gradually. In 2007, the lithium electrochemical materials business was written into the main business of Sugihiro stock, and the revenue share of the clothing business declined year by year, until 2013, the revenue of the lithium electrical materials business of Sugihiro stock completely exceeded the clothing business.
